Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.80,0:00:02.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.10,0:00:04.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Population: eight billion.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.90,0:00:09.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Now… imagine every one of them, gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.70,0:00:12.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Hour one.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.10,0:00:17.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}The power plants run on, with no one left to feed them.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.40,0:00:20.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}One by one… the lights go out.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.60,0:00:23.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Hour thirty-six.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.30,0:00:28.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Beneath New York, seven hundred and fifty pumps have stopped.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.40,0:00:30.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}The subway floods.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.20,0:00:32.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Year twenty.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.60,0:00:35.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Roots split the asphalt.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.00,0:00:37.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Trees rise through the streets.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.40,0:00:40.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Year three hundred.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.20,0:00:45.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}With no one to paint it, the Eiffel Tower rusts…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.10,0:00:46.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}and falls.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.60,0:00:49.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Year five hundred.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.20,0:00:52.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Forests have taken back our cities.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.00,0:00:56.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}But one thing we made will outlast us all…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.50,0:00:57.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Plastic.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.80,0:01:01.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Still here, thousands of years from now.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.70,0:01:06.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}So tell me… would Earth even miss us?
